</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 7: </span>Influence of P-D Ratio(256+256, QPS2)</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.F8" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S4.F8.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2509.17542v1/Fig8.1.png" id="S4.F8.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:236/142;" width="236" height="142" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>Latency(s)</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S4.F8.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2509.17542v1/Fig8.2.png" id="S4.F8.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:236/142;" width="236" height="142" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>Latency(s)</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="S4.F8.sf3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2509.17542v1/Fig8.3.png" id="S4.F8.sf3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:236/142;" width="236" height="142" alt="Refer to caption">
