<figure id="S4.F10.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2509.17542v1/Fig10.2.png" id="S4.F10.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:236/142;" width="236" height="142" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>Latency(s)</figcaption>
